WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.242
A global order by can be expensive because Spark must coordinate an ordering across the entire result.

00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:14.187
That may be necessary for a final report or a small result that truly needs a global order.

00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:18.057
But many intermediate transformations do not require it.

00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:25.262
Do not sort data simply because ordered output looks nicer while you are developing the pipeline.

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:29.539
Sort when the order is part of the actual analytical requirement.
